Let's expand the powers for $\greenD{x^9}=\blueD{12^2}\cdot\purpleD{12^7}$.

$\begin{align}
&=\blueD{\underbrace{12\cdot12}_\text{2 times}}\cdot\purpleD{\underbrace{12\cdot12\cdot12\cdot12\cdot12\cdot12\cdot12    }_\text{7 times}}
\\\\\\
&=\greenD{\underbrace{x\cdot x\cdot x\cdot x\cdot  x\cdot  x\cdot x\cdot x \cdot x}_\text{9 times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
